    "preamble": "Jali Chandra Sekhar Reddy, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 6 February, 2020 Author: J. Uma Devi Bench: J.Uma Devi The Hon'Ble Ms.JUSTICE J.Uma Devi Criminal Petition No.684 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioners/ A-1 to A-3, seeking to quash the proceedings in Crime No.07 of 2020 on the file of Rajupalem Police Station, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 270 and 273 I.P.C and Section 56, 57(1) and 63 of Food Safety Standards Act. The case on hand has also been filed questioning the proceedings in Crime No.07 of 2020, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 270 and 273 I.P.C and Section 56, 57(1) and 63 of Food Safety Standards Act.",
